open-classroom-ai
=================

This repository is a classroom approval / quota / bridge integration that works
with Open WebUI. Original classroom service, bridge, Pipe/Filter, teacher and
student UI, scripts, and docs in this repository are licensed under the MIT
License (see LICENSE).

